WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.769
Closing a month

00:00:05.819 --> 00:00:11.553
Open Finance, then Accounts. Close Month is at the top of the page.

00:00:13.260 --> 00:00:19.218
At the end of a month, press Close Month. Choose the month and year to close.

00:00:20.983 --> 00:00:29.431
Closing locks the period: no transactions can be added or edited in that month afterwards. Tick the box to confirm.

00:00:30.909 --> 00:00:36.277
Press Close Month again. The page now shows the last closed month.

00:00:39.771 --> 00:00:44.450
Month closed
